ld #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]bob capture refuses unconfirmed email-task closes[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]capture[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture: last-gate post-pass that finds Gmail Tasks a capture would [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]close, the mail_close JSON payload, the -m/--mail-close DIGEST [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirmation, human output, and docs.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Mail Close Card and guard API in Bob Navigation Hotkeys[/bold #D7AFFF]       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]navcard[dim] · [dim][/dim]after model[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]navcard: model twin, the card modal, nav api.mailCloseGuard v1, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]guarding every nav-owned close path including review-walk landings.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Task Status Cycler closes go through the guard[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cycler[dim] · [dim][/dim]after navcard[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cycler: guard Ctrl+Enter, Alt+[ / Alt+], counted, Task Link, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]transclusion, Pomodoro-cascade, and offer-close writes with a sync fast [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, fail-closed fallback, and checkbox clicks.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bob Mac Capture shows the Mail Close Card[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: preview banner, a Mail Close card opened from bob's refusal, Y to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]confirm with the digest, and docs and CI.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Cross-surface verification and records[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after capture, cycler, mac[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: replay the original accident on every surface, capture light and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dark card screenshots, and land the memory records the review accepted.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-px","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-px.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-d11269c8035004663420465c805a7967","started_at":"2026-11-24T17:24:14.164753+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"commits":{"digest":"07b67fe3cd36fbb88e8d4aa82d59ea95c9dee2aa97621f7414ea320f66a95237","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"3942241a63c5de53df93bede886ed35a51f8b6a33d5883d819c898d7dd34f408","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":83},"meta":{"digest":"916bd17c6eb05d7bc41e2e96246336286998ed7c48e0f9ec0b5c1810351a6b89","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3/meta.json","size_bytes":688},"prompt":{"digest":"f8408a3fcb891d6943e198025e230736cf41d969e32776d52d6139da01d9c6f5","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3/prompt.md","size_bytes":176},"prompt_steps":{"digest":"d5e3b0d1435d7db1f3f3055b97497627a5d2165ba2b7d8c6c38e1d67aeafa108","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3/prompt_steps.json","size_bytes":4225},"state":{"digest":"a572e3bbf7d9596c7651c1894b4f656b50adbaebd9fce21e57ad15b2ca3c83f0","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-px.3","local_name":"bob-cli-px.3","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-px","agent_c